#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:2
msgid "Visual diff"
msgstr "Visual diff"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:4
msgid ""
"Get a list of documentation files that changed between the :doc:`pull "
"request </pull-requests>` and the latest version of the documentation, and "
"see their differences highlighted visually on the documentation pages."
msgstr ""
"获取 :doc:`Pull Request </pull-requests>` "
"与文档最新版本之间发生变化的文档文件列表，并在文档页面上以可视化方式高亮显示差异。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:7
msgid ""
"While seeing changes in source files is helpful, it can be difficult to "
"understand how those changes will look in the rendered documentation, or "
"their impact on the documentation as a whole. Read the Docs makes it easy to"
" see the changes in the rendered documentation."
msgstr "查看源文件中的变更有帮助，但很难理解这些变更在渲染后文档中的样子，或对整体文档的影响。Read the Docs 让渲染后文档中的变更一目了然。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:13
msgid "Show diff menu in preview"
msgstr "在预览中显示差异菜单"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:15
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:39
msgid "To enable or disable this feature for your project:"
msgstr "为你的项目启用或禁用此功能："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:17
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Visual diff`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Visual diff` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:18
msgid "Check or uncheck the :guilabel:`Visual diff enabled` option."
msgstr "勾选或取消勾选 :guilabel:`Visual diff enabled` 选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:19
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:61
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Save` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:21
msgid ""
"When enabled, a new UI element appears at the top right of the page showing "
"a dropdown selector containing all the files that have changed in that pull "
"request build."
msgstr "启用后，页面右上角会出现新的 UI 元素，显示一个下拉选择器，列出该 Pull Request 构建中所有发生变化的文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:26
msgid ""
"You can select any of those files from the dropdown to jump directly into "
"that page. Once there, you can toggle Visual Diff on and off by pressing the"
" :guilabel:`Show diff` link from the UI element, or pressing the ``d`` key "
"if you have hotkeys enabled."
msgstr ""
"你可以从下拉框中选择任一文件直接跳转到该页面。进入后，可点击 UI 元素中的 :guilabel:`Show diff` 链接开关 Visual "
"Diff，若启用了热键也可按 ``d`` 键。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:29
msgid ""
"Visual diff shows all the sections that have changed, highlighting their "
"differences with red/green background colors. You can jump between each of "
"these chunks by clicking on the up/down arrows."
msgstr "Visual diff 显示所有发生变化的章节，用红/绿背景色高亮差异。点击上下箭头可在各差异块之间跳转。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:33
msgid "Show build overview in pull requests"
msgstr "在 Pull Request 中显示构建概览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:37
msgid ""
"This feature is only available for projects connected to a :ref:`reference"
"/git-integration:GitHub App`."
msgstr "此功能仅对连接了 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` 的项目可用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:41
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Pull request builds`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Pull request builds` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:42
msgid "Check or uncheck the :guilabel:`Show build overview in a comment` option."
msgstr "勾选或取消勾选 :guilabel:`Show build overview in a comment` 选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:43
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Update`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Update` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:45
msgid ""
"When enabled, a comment is added to the pull request when changes are "
"detected between the pull request and the latest version of the "
"documentation."
msgstr "启用后，当检测到 Pull Request 与文档最新版本之间存在变更时，会在 Pull Request 上添加评论。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:50
msgid "General settings"
msgstr "常规设置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:53
msgid "Ignored files"
msgstr "忽略的文件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:55
msgid ""
"You can configure a list of files or patterns to be ignored when listing the"
" files that changed in the pull request. This is useful when you have files "
"that have a date in them, or listing/archive files that show changes without"
" content changes in those files."
msgstr "你可以配置一份在列出 Pull Request 变更文件时需忽略的文件或模式列表。这在文件含有日期，或列表/归档文件仅因内容未变而显示变化时很有用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:59
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> File tree diff`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> File tree diff` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:60
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Ignored files` field, add one or more patterns to ignore, "
"one per line."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`Ignored files` 字段中添加一个或多个要忽略的模式，每行一个。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:63
msgid ""
"Patterns are matched against the relative paths of the HTML files produced "
"by the build, you should try to match ``index.html``, not "
"``docs/index.rst``, nor ``/en/latest/index.html``. Patterns can include one "
"or more of the following special characters:"
msgstr ""
"模式与构建生成的 HTML 文件的相对路径匹配，应尝试匹配 ``index.html`` ，而非 ``docs/index.rst`` 或 "
"``/en/latest/index.html`` 。模式可包含以下一个或多个特殊字符："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:67
msgid "``*`` matches everything, including slashes."
msgstr "``*`` 匹配所有内容，包括斜杠。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:68
msgid "``?`` matches any single character."
msgstr "``?`` 匹配任意单个字符。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:69
msgid "``[seq]`` matches any character in ``seq``."
msgstr "``[seq]`` 匹配 ``seq`` 中的任意字符。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:72
msgid "Base version"
msgstr "基础版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:74
msgid ""
"The base version is the version of the documentation that is used to compare"
" against the pull request. By default, this is the ``latest`` version of the"
" documentation. This is useful if your ``latest`` version doesn't point to "
"the default branch of your repository."
msgstr ""
"基础版本是用于与 Pull Request 对比的文档版本。默认为文档的 ``latest`` 版本。若你的 ``latest`` "
"版本未指向仓库的默认分支，此设置很有用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:80
msgid "This option can be changed by contacting :doc:`/support`."
msgstr "此选项可通过联系 :doc:`/support` 修改。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:82
msgid ""
"When the first successful build of a pull request runs, Read the Docs takes "
"a snapshot of the base version's current file manifest and pins it as the "
"baseline for that pull request. Subsequent builds of the pull request are "
"compared against this pinned snapshot instead of whatever the base version "
"happens to contain at that moment. This prevents unrelated files from "
"appearing as changed when the base branch moves forward while the pull "
"request is open."
msgstr ""
"当 Pull Request 的首次成功构建立即运行时，Read the Docs 会获取基础版本当前文件清单的快照，并将其固定为该 Pull "
"Request 的基线。此后该 Pull Request 的构建都与这一固定快照对比，而非与基础版本当时恰好包含的内容对比。这样可避免在 Pull "
"Request 打开期间基础分支前进时，无关文件被显示为已变更。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:92
msgid "How main content is detected"
msgstr "主要内容如何检测"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:94
msgid ""
"The visual diff compares the \"main content\" of HTML pages, ignoring "
"headers, footers, navigation, and other page elements that aren't part of "
"the documentation content itself. This helps avoid false positives, like all"
" pages being marked as changed because of a date or commit hash being "
"updated in the footer."
msgstr ""
"Visual diff 比较 HTML "
"页面的\"主要内容\"，忽略不属于文档内容的页眉、页脚、导航等页面元素。这有助于避免误报，例如因页脚日期或提交哈希更新而导致所有页面都被标记为已变更。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:98
msgid ""
"For details on how the main content area is detected, see :ref:`reference"
"/main-content-detection:detection logic`."
msgstr "主要内容区域的检测方式详见 :ref:`reference/main-content-detection:detection logic` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:103
msgid ""
"If the heuristic root element picked by Visual Diff is wrong for your "
"project theme, set the :guilabel:`CSS main content selector` in your "
"project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Advanced`. Visual Diff "
"honors this override; other features like Server Side Search do not."
msgstr ""
"若 Visual Diff 启发式选取的根元素不适合你的项目主题，可在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons "
"--> Advanced` 中设置 :guilabel:`CSS main content selector` 。Visual Diff "
"会遵循该覆盖，服务器端搜索等其他功能则不会。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:106
msgid "Limitations and known issues"
msgstr "限制与已知问题"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:108
msgid "The diff considers HTML files only."
msgstr "差异比较仅考虑 HTML 文件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:109
msgid ""
"The diff is done between the files from the latest successful build of the "
"pull request and the default base version (latest by default). A snapshot of"
" the base version's manifest is saved on the first successful build of the "
"pull request, so the diff stays stable as the base branch moves forward. If "
"the pull request is later updated against a newer base, the snapshot is not "
"currently refreshed automatically, and the diff may show stale differences "
"until this is addressed in a future update."
msgstr ""
"差异在 Pull Request 最近一次成功构建的文件与默认基础版本（默认为 latest）之间计算。基础版本清单的快照会在 Pull Request"
" 首次成功构建时保存，因此基础分支前进时差异保持稳定。若 Pull Request "
"后续基于更新的基础版本刷新，当前还不会自动刷新该快照，在未来更新解决前差异可能显示过时内容。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:112
msgid ""
"Invisible changes. Some sections may be highlighted as changed, even when "
"they haven't actually visually changed. This can happen when the underlying "
"HTML changes without a corresponding visual change, for example, if a link's"
" URL is updated."
msgstr "不可见变更。某些章节即使视觉上未实际改变，也可能被高亮为已变更。当底层 HTML 变化但无对应视觉变化时会发生这种情况，例如链接 URL 被更新。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:114
msgid ""
"Tables may be shown to have changes when they have not actually changed. "
"This is due to subtle variations in how HTML tables are rendered, and will "
"be fixed in a future version."
msgstr "表格在实际未变化时也可能显示有变更。这源于 HTML 表格渲染方式的细微差异，将在后续版本修复。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/visual-diff.rst:116
msgid ""
"The background of diff chunks may be incorrect when we are unable to detect "
"the correct main parent element for the chunk."
msgstr "当无法为差异块检测到正确的主要父元素时，其背景色可能不正确。"

